  "title": "Brown and Wild Rice Salad with Grapes and Kale",
  "description": "Tossed in a sweet and tangy dressing with fresh kale, nuts, fruit, and other vegetables, this brown and wild rice salad is perfect for summer gatherings.",
  "authors": [
    "Missy"
  ],
